 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-reserva-3-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac x{\\ln(x)}\\) para \\(x\\gt0\\), \\(x\\neq1\\) (donde \\(\\ln\\) denota el logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Estudia y determina las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula la ecuación de la recta tangente y de la recta normal a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=e\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El dominio es \\((0,1)\\cup(1,+\\infty)\\).</p><p><b>Asíntotas verticales.</b> Candidatos: \\(x=1\\) (anula el denominador) y \\(x=0\\) (extremo del dominio).</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to1^-}\\frac x{\\ln x}=\\frac1{0^-}=-\\infty,\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to1^+}\\frac x{\\ln x}=\\frac1{0^+}=+\\infty\\]\\[\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac x{\\ln x}=\\frac{0^+}{-\\infty}=0\\]<p>\\(x=1\\) es asíntota vertical; \\(x=0\\) no lo es.</p><p><b>Asíntota horizontal</b> (solo tiene sentido \\(x\\to+\\infty\\)):</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac x{\\ln x}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac1{1/x}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}x=+\\infty\\]<p>No hay horizontal<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>. <b>Oblicua</b> \\(y=mx+n\\):</p>\\[m=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}x=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac1{\\ln x}=0\\]<p>Con \\(m=0\\) no hay asíntota oblicua<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si \\(m=0\\), la asíntota sería horizontal, y ya hemos visto que \\(f\\to+\\infty\\).</i>.</p><div class='res'>La única asíntota es la vertical \\(x=1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f(e)=\\frac e{\\ln e}=e,\\qquad f'(x)=\\frac{\\ln x-x\\cdot\\frac1x}{(\\ln x)^2}=\\frac{\\ln x-1}{(\\ln x)^2}\\Rightarrow f'(e)=\\frac{1-1}1=0\\]<p>La tangente es horizontal: \\(y=e\\). La normal es perpendicular a ella, así que es vertical<i class='n' data-t='why'>Cuando la tangente es horizontal (\\(f'(a)=0\\)), la normal no tiene pendiente: es la recta vertical \\(x=a\\).</i>: \\(x=e\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='29.5,134.1 29.9,134.1 30.3,134.2 30.7,134.3 31.1,134.4 31.5,134.5 31.9,134.6 32.3,134.7 32.8,134.8 33.2,135.0 33.6,135.1 34.0,135.3 34.4,135.4 34.8,135.6 35.2,135.8 35.7,136.0 36.1,136.2 36.5,136.4 36.9,136.6 37.3,136.9 37.7,137.2 38.1,137.4 38.6,137.7 39.0,138.0 39.4,138.4 39.8,138.7 40.2,139.1 40.6,139.5 41.0,139.9 41.4,140.3 41.9,140.8 42.3,141.3 42.7,141.8 43.1,142.4 43.5,143.0 43.9,143.6 44.3,144.3 44.8,145.0 45.2,145.8 45.6,146.6 46.0,147.5 46.4,148.4 46.8,149.5 47.2,150.6 47.7,151.8 48.1,153.1 48.5,154.5 48.9,156.1 49.3,157.8 49.7,159.7 50.1,161.8 50.5,164.1 51.0,166.6 51.4,169.5 51.8,172.8 52.2,176.5 52.6,180.7 53.0,185.6 53.4,191.3 53.9,198.1 54.3,206.2' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='62.2,16.9 64.9,56.5 67.6,72.8 70.3,81.5 73.0,86.8 75.7,90.4 78.4,92.9 81.0,94.7 83.7,96.0 86.4,97.0 89.1,97.7 91.8,98.3 94.5,98.7 97.2,99.1 99.8,99.3 102.5,99.4 105.2,99.5 107.9,99.6 110.6,99.6 113.3,99.5 115.9,99.5 118.6,99.4 121.3,99.3 124.0,99.1 126.7,99.0 129.4,98.8 132.1,98.6 134.7,98.4 137.4,98.2 140.1,98.0 142.8,97.8 145.5,97.6 148.2,97.4 150.9,97.1 153.5,96.9 156.2,96.6 158.9,96.4 161.6,96.1 164.3,95.9 167.0,95.6 169.6,95.3 172.3,95.1 175.0,94.8 177.7,94.5 180.4,94.3 183.1,94.0 185.8,93.7 188.4,93.4 191.1,93.2 193.8,92.9 196.5,92.6 199.2,92.3 201.9,92.0 204.6,91.8 207.2,91.5 209.9,91.2 212.6,90.9 215.3,90.6 218.0,90.3 220.7,90.0 223.3,89.8 226.0,89.5 228.7,89.2 231.4,88.9 234.1,88.6 236.8,88.3 239.5,88.0 242.1,87.7 244.8,87.5 247.5,87.2 250.2,86.9 252.9,86.6 255.6,86.3 258.3,86.0 260.9,85.7 263.6,85.4 266.3,85.2 269.0,84.9 271.7,84.6 274.4,84.3 277.0,84.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='58.4' y1='210.0' x2='58.4' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><line x1='20.0' y1='99.6' x2='280.0' y2='99.6' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='109.2' y1='210.0' x2='109.2' y2='20.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='109.2' cy='99.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='115.2' y='115.6'>(e, e)</text><text x='61.4' y='27.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='9'>x = 1</text><text x='194.3' y='106.1' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = e</text><text x='114.5' y='197.3' fill='#16a34a' font-size='10'>x = e</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 134.0H294.0M28.9 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='58.4' y1='131.0' x2='58.4' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='55.4' y='148.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='88.0' y1='131.0' x2='88.0' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='85.0' y='148.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='117.5' y1='131.0' x2='117.5' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='114.5' y='148.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='147.0' y1='131.0' x2='147.0' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='144.0' y='148.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='176.6' y1='131.0' x2='176.6' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='173.6' y='148.0' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='206.1' y1='131.0' x2='206.1' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='203.1' y='148.0' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='235.7' y1='131.0' x2='235.7' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='232.7' y='148.0' font-size='10'>7</text><line x1='265.2' y1='131.0' x2='265.2' y2='137.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='262.2' y='148.0' font-size='10'>8</text><line x1='25.9' y1='184.7' x2='31.9' y2='184.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='12.9' y='188.7' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='25.9' y1='83.3' x2='31.9' y2='83.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='12.9' y='87.3' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='25.9' y1='32.7' x2='31.9' y2='32.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='12.9' y='36.7' font-size='10'>8</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Tangente \\(y=e\\); normal \\(x=e\\)</div></div>"
    }
