   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-reserva-3-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&-3\\\\-1&m&m-2\\\\m&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\), \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(X=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Determina el rango de \\(A\\) según los valores del parámetro \\(m\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Discute el sistema \\(AX=B\\) según los valores del parámetro \\(m\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Resuelve el sistema \\(AX=B\\) para \\(m=1\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1&-3\\\\-1&m&m-2\\\\m&0&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 4 m+m^{2} - 2 m+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(- 3 m^{2}+0-2\\bigr)\\]\\[=4m^2-6m+2=2(m-1)(2m-1)\\]\\[|A|=0\\iff\\boxed{m=1}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{m=\\frac12}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(m\\neq1,\\frac12\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&-3\\\\-1&1&-1\\\\1&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\), y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1\\\\-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=\\frac12\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&-3\\\\-1&\\frac12&-\\frac32\\\\\\frac12&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\), y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}-1&\\frac12\\\\\\frac12&0\\end{vmatrix}=-\\frac14\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3\\) si \\(m\\neq1,\\frac12\\); \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) si \\(m=1\\) o \\(m=\\frac12\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i> con \\(A^*=(A\\,|\\,B)\\).</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m\\neq1,\\frac12\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). El otro menor de orden 3 de \\(A^*\\) que contiene al menor no nulo es el de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1&1\\\\-1&1&1\\\\1&0&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+1+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2=\\operatorname{rg}A\\lt3\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=\\frac12\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las filas 2 y 3 ampliado con la fila 1 y las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}-2&1&1\\\\-1&\\frac12&1\\\\\\frac12&0&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+\\frac{1}{2}+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(\\frac{1}{4}+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=\\frac14\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\neq\\operatorname{rg}A\\). <b>Incompatible.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(m\\neq1,\\frac12\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(m=1\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(m=\\frac12\\): incompatible</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=1\\) me quedo con las dos primeras ecuaciones (contienen el menor no nulo):</p>\\[\\begin{cases}-2x+y-3z=1\\\\-x+y-z=1\\end{cases}\\]<p>Restando, \\(-x-2z=0\\). Con \\(z=t\\): \\(x=-2t\\) e \\(y=1+x+z=1-t\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=-2t,\\ y=1-t,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(t=1\\), \\((-2,0,1)\\): \\(4+0-3=1\\) ✓, \\(2+0-1=1\\) ✓, \\(-2+0+2=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
   ],
