  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-reserva-3-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera los puntos \\(A(1,2,1)\\), \\(B(-1,0,2)\\) y \\(C(3,2,0)\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) determinado por ellos.",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta \\(r\\) que está contenida en \\(\\pi\\) y tal que \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) son simétricos respecto de \\(r\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Calcula la distancia de \\(A\\) a \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Plano </b>\\(\\pi\\)<b>.</b> \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-2,-2,1)\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(2,0,-1)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&-2&1\\\\2&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}=(2,0,4)\\parallel(1,0,2)\\]<p>\\(\\pi\\) es de la forma \\(x+2z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A\\): \\(1+2+D=0\\iff D=-3\\). \\(\\pi\\equiv x+2z-3=0\\).</p><p><b>Recta </b>\\(r\\)<b>.</b> Para que \\(A\\) y \\(B\\) sean simétricos respecto de \\(r\\), \\(r\\) tiene que pasar por el punto medio \\(M\\) de \\(AB\\) y ser perpendicular a \\(AB\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El simétrico de \\(A\\) respecto de una recta se obtiene por la perpendicular a la recta, y la recta corta al segmento en su punto medio.</i>. Además está en \\(\\pi\\), así que su director es perpendicular a \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\) y a \\(\\vec n\\):</p>\\[M=\\left(\\frac{1-1}2,\\frac{2+0}2,\\frac{1+2}2\\right)=\\left(0,1,\\frac32\\right)\\]\\[\\vec d=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-2&-2&1\\\\1&0&2\\end{vmatrix}=(-4,\\,5,\\,2)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":3,\"el\":62,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-1.537,2.6,2.268],[-1.537,-0.6,2.268],[1.537,-0.6,0.732],[1.537,2.6,0.732]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[1.537,-0.6,0.732],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.4,-0.75,0.8],[-1.4,2.75,2.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-1.4,2.75,2.2],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[1,2,1],[-1,0,2],\"#16a34a\",2.0,false],[\"line\",[0.2,1.2,1.4],[0.021,1.424,1.489],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.021,1.424,1.489],[-0.179,1.224,1.589],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,2,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,0,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,1.5],\"M\",-16,14]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m13r3a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m13r3a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m13r3a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m13r3a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='248.9,27.4 45.3,18.0 35.1,236.6 238.7,246.0' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='39.1' y='236.6' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='26.0' y1='226.4' x2='258.0' y2='37.6' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='264.0' y='37.6' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='202.3' y1='206.1' x2='81.7' y2='57.9' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0'/><line x1='154.1' y1='146.8' x2='168.9' y2='134.7' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='168.9' y1='134.7' x2='156.8' y2='119.9' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='202.3' cy='206.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='209.3' y='200.1' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='81.7' cy='57.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='88.7' y='51.9' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='142.0' cy='132.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='126.0' y='146.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='23.2' y2='284.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='19.9' y='293.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='40.0' y2='270.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='42.6' y='275.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='262.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='263.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(260.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=-4\\lambda\\\\y=1+5\\lambda\\\\z=\\frac32+2\\lambda\\end{cases}\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(M\\in\\pi\\) (\\(0+3-3=0\\)) ✓, \\(\\vec d\\cdot\\vec n=-4+4=0\\) ✓ y \\(\\vec d\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=8-10+2=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(M\\) es un punto de \\(r\\) y \\(\\overrightarrow{AM}\\) es perpendicular a \\(r\\), así que \\(M\\) es la proyección de \\(A\\) sobre \\(r\\):</p>\\[d(A,r)=|\\overrightarrow{AM}|=\\left|\\left(-1,-1,\\frac12\\right)\\right|=\\sqrt{1+1+\\frac14}=\\frac32\\]<div class='res'>\\(d(A,r)=\\dfrac32\\) unidades</div></div>"
    }
   ],
