  {
   "id": "matematicas-2013-reserva-3-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera las rectas \\(r\\) y \\(s\\) dadas por \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=2-3\\lambda\\\\y=3+5\\lambda\\\\z=\\lambda\\end{cases}\\) y \\(s\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+y-1=0\\\\z-5=0\\end{cases}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina la posición relativa de \\(r\\) y \\(s\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia entre \\(r\\) y \\(s\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Paso \\(s\\) a paramétricas: con \\(x=\\mu\\), \\(y=1-\\mu\\), \\(z=5\\).</p><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(2,\\ 3,\\ 0)\\) con \\(\\vec u=(-3,\\ 5,\\ 1)\\); \\(s\\) pasa por \\(S(0,\\ 1,\\ 5)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(1,\\ -1,\\ 0)\\). Los directores no son proporcionales, así que las rectas se cortan o se cruzan. Con \\(\\overrightarrow{RS}=(-2,\\ -2,\\ 5)\\) calculo el producto mixto por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i><i class='n' data-t='th'>Si el producto mixto es 0 las rectas son coplanarias y se cortan; si no, se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{RS},\\vec u,\\vec v]=\\begin{vmatrix}-2&-2&5\\\\-3&5&1\\\\1&-1&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0-2+15\\bigr)-\\bigl(25+2+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-14\\neq0\\]<p>Las rectas <b>se cruzan</b>.</p><div class='res'>\\(r\\) y \\(s\\) se cruzan</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p> La distancia es la longitud del segmento \\(PQ\\) perpendicular a las dos (\\(P\\in r\\), \\(Q\\in s\\))<i class='n' data-t='why'>El segmento perpendicular común es el camino más corto entre dos rectas que se cruzan.</i>:</p>\\[P(2-3t,\\ 3+5t,\\ t),\\quad Q(\\mu,\\ 1-\\mu,\\ 5),\\quad\\overrightarrow{PQ}=(\\mu + 3 t - 2,\\ - \\mu - 5 t - 2,\\ 5 - t)\\]\\[\\begin{cases}\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec u=0\\\\\\overrightarrow{PQ}\\cdot\\vec v=0\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}- 8 \\mu - 35 t + 1=0\\\\2 \\mu + 8 t=0\\end{cases}\\]<p>Resolviendo: \\(t=\\frac{1}{3}\\), \\(\\mu=-\\frac{4}{3}\\). Entonces \\(P\\left(1,\\ \\frac{14}{3},\\ \\frac{1}{3}\\right)\\) y \\(Q\\left(-\\frac{4}{3},\\ \\frac{7}{3},\\ 5\\right)\\):</p>\\[d(r,s)=|\\overrightarrow{PQ}|=\\left|\\left(-\\frac{7}{3},\\ -\\frac{7}{3},\\ \\frac{14}{3}\\right)\\right|=\\frac{7 \\sqrt{6}}{3}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":36,\"el\":26,\"p\":[[\"line\",[5.8,-3.333,-1.267],[-3.8,12.667,1.933],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-3.8,12.667,1.933],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-2.933,3.933,5.0],[0.267,0.733,5.0],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[0.267,0.733,5.0],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"line\",[1.0,4.667,0.333],[-1.333,2.333,5.0],\"#c2410c\",2.0,false],[\"line\",[0.873,4.878,0.376],[0.771,4.776,0.58],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[0.771,4.776,0.58],[0.898,4.565,0.537],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-1.157,2.157,5.0],[-1.054,2.259,4.796],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-1.054,2.259,4.796],[-1.231,2.435,4.796],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1.0,4.667,0.333],\"P\",8,12],[\"pt\",[-1.333,2.333,5.0],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 178' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m13r3b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m13r3b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m13r3b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m13r3b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='124.3' x2='314.0' y2='90.8' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='90.8' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='196.6' y1='18.0' x2='127.4' y2='22.8' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='133.4' y='22.8' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='170.0' y1='107.5' x2='162.0' y2='20.4' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.0'/><line x1='173.8' y1='107.1' x2='173.5' y2='103.3' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='173.5' y1='103.3' x2='169.7' y2='103.7' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='158.2' y1='20.7' x2='158.5' y2='24.5' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='158.5' y1='24.5' x2='162.4' y2='24.2' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='170.0' cy='107.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='178.0' y='119.5' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='162.0' cy='20.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='169.0' y='14.4' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='148' x2='14.6' y2='153.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.3' y='159.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='148' x2='36.9' y2='152.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='38.5' y='157.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='148' x2='24.0' y2='133.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='132.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,170)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-widt